From: bornaradusin <bornaradusin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 08:20:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 45/47] PC5: the controllers are XInput devices to a game that
 checks (Wine patch 0933)

A game that leaves XInput devices to XInput finds them by the device
manager's list (WMI's Win32_PnPEntity). PC5's controllers weren't in it,
so Batman: Arkham Knight took the controller for a joystick of another
kind, which it doesn't play with, and never asked XInput for it. Each
controller is listed now as Windows lists an Xbox 360 controller.
